  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/01OT">Lemma <span data-tag="01OT">28.4.5</span>.</a> The following properties of a ring $R$ are local. </p>
  <p><ol>
  <li><p>
(Cohen-Macaulay.) The ring $R$ is Noetherian and CM, see Algebra, Definition <a href="/tag/00NC" data-tag="00NC">10.104.6</a>. 
</p>
</li><li><p>
(Regular.) The ring $R$ is Noetherian and regular, see Algebra, Definition <a href="/tag/00OD" data-tag="00OD">10.110.7</a>. 
</p>
</li><li><p>
(Absolutely Noetherian.) The ring $R$ is of finite type over $Z$. 
</p>
</li><li><p>
